            <title>3.18.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:19:04 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>202</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.18.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- The Dock icon now shows a badge with the number of sessions waiting on you — asking for permission or an answer, or finished with a reply you haven't looked at yet. It clears as you visit them. If no badge appears, check that notifications and badges are allowed for Canopy in System Settings → Notifications.
]]></description>
